- `vite build` ✓, `tsc --noEmit` ✓, `eslint`: 1 pre-existing error in `tailwind.config.ts` (a file I didn't touch) plus pre-existing shadcn warnings — unrelated to the injection. No behavior, styling, or copy changed.

